#passage(("You're arguing principles and concepts which all human beings essentially in generality agree upon. You're trying to make it seem as if we don't understand them. And you're doing that to escape the idea that now, if you follow the rational conclusion and the reasoning, you have to come to the conclusion there must be a higher power, something that brings the universe into existence.", "There can be nothing, but there hasn't been nothing, because if there was, we wouldn't exist. That's the argument we make. We're not saying nothing cannot exist. We're saying it didn't exist because we're here. It is possible. But it's not possible if we exist.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Atheist Abandons Logic And Rationality To Deny God! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=s5DUzwdtzqE", ((1208, "20:08–20:26"), (1244, "20:44–20:59"),))
