#passage(("Do you make a positive claim that there is no God, or you just say that's my own opinion, that I cannot substantiate that there is no God? I'll tell you about positive claims that I can make. But you're on defense, you don't know! You think it's more probable for you that there is no Creator.", "What does the religions have to do with you believing in the Big Bang? Are you saying I believe in the Big Bang because religions have things which are incorrect? Just because religions – if we assume they are false – it's not proof that Science is true or the Big Bang is true. That doesn't follow logic.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Is Atheism Rational? Atheist Challenges Muslim! | Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hFzWhMCQFn4", ((746, "12:26–12:51"), (903, "15:03–15:40"),))
