#passage(("We know 0 plus 0 plus 0 equals 0. You go to a baby, you go to a child, they understand this concept very easily, because we know the absence of something does not produce something. It's as simple as that. What people refer to as magic today is when you say, \"Oh, he brought something out of nothing, out of thin air.\" Because they know that doesn't happen. Even that's not nothing. But even that, human beings will reject.", "We know this universe has a starting point, the big bang. So, that requires a cause by definition. Nobody can say, \"Oh, I don't know.\" Doesn't answer the question. If I ask you what time is it today and you say I don't know, doesn't mean there is no answer to that question. So there is an answer whether you know it or not. Similarly with the beginning of the universe. There is something that brings the universe into existence.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Atheist Comes To Mock Islam But Gets Humiliated Instead! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lS_BJCpAXmw", ((122, "2:02–2:29"), (152, "2:32–2:58"),))
