#passage(("What is the cause that caused the Big Bang? And how did it expand in the exact precise way that it expanded, to allow the universe to exist, number one, and two, to allow life to exist? How did that happen?", "So the \"I don't know escape card\" doesn't work – the \"I don't know escape card\", which all atheists and agnostics use whenever they are put with a question that is destroying the worldview in a way – because you need to account for that. I did not bring the word God in my question. You're jumping into assumptions. Now, taking God away from the picture, there is a cause, by definition. That's what common sense would say. You don't know what the cause is, but you know there is a cause.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Heated Atheist Challenges A Muslim To Prove The Existence Of God! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YGW_AhJHSQ4", ((198, "3:18–3:35"), (246, "4:06–5:09"),))
