#passage(("The reason I know for a fact that there is a Creator, the evidence for it, for me, is the universe. What do I mean by that? The universe cannot be created except if certain attributes are possessed by whatever created the universe. Meaning, it would require power we cannot even comprehend to be able to compress this universe into a singularity, to create a universe that is full of atoms. Each atom is full of so much energy; if we split it, we have a nuclear explosion. That's how nuclear explosions are. The universe is all atoms.", "Now, it will have knowledge that we cannot even comprehend, because of all of the gravitational systems, because of all of the electromagnetic waves, of the constellations, of all of this universe that we still haven't fully discovered until this day. So, whatever brings the universe into existence, which is not bound by time-space continuous the same way we are, it's not restricted by the same way we're restricted. Rather, it made it, it created it. So, if it brought the universe into existence and time-space continuous, and has power we cannot even comprehend, and knowledge you cannot even comprehend, it is by necessity what people refer to as God.", "Now, I can know that for a fact because there is a universe. And if there is a universe, then by necessity, 100% fact, whatever brings it into existence requires these attributes. For example, if you have a phone in your hand, it is a fact that whatever created that phone had knowledge of language, had the ability to assemble materials, whatever. These necessary attributes to create a phone must have been there. Otherwise, there cannot be a phone. So, the phone itself can be 100% fact and proof for the existence of the manufacturer that has certain attributes. That's one evidence, by the way; there are other evidence, but that's an example of a rational evidence, a case that is made to show that there must be something that brings this universe into existence.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “\"Enlightened\" Athiest Left Speechless After Encountering Muslim! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UWPH8DYyBGA", ((634, "10:34–11:28"), (691, "11:31–11:58"), (724, "12:04–12:58"),))
